30=
31=v1.1
32=+ The `dnscrypt-proxy` package is no longer required
33=+ Fully autonomous `RPM` and `DEB` packages (self-contained)
34=+ Own systemd service - `/etc/systemd/user/dnscrypt-proxy.service`
35=+ The latest `dnscrypt-proxy` (v2.1.14) build from the developer's github is already inside
36=
37=**Note:** For a clean install and use, you need to remove `dnscrypt-proxy` if it was installed from the repository.
38=
